menu "POG voice satellite"
    config POG_VOICE
        bool "Enable the POG AI push-to-talk satellite"
        depends on POG_MIC_SHARED_CLOCKS
        default n
        help
            Explicit listen/stop/cancel controls, authenticated enrolment,
            Opus over WebSocket v3 and spoken replies. No wake word or AEC.
            Microphone streaming never starts automatically after boot.
endmenu
